#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:75
#: 874ac354fcdf440c96dae9d1c897743a
msgid "To read analog voltage type RSSI,  :ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>`  can be set to any free ADC pin available. On pixhawk / cube type boards, this includes the sBus out / RSSI input pin (103). When using dedicated ADC pins, the corresponding pin number usually matches the ADC1 channel used on that pin. See the DMA1 map in the `respective processor's alternative function table <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/scripts>`__ for further reference."
msgstr ""

